  "statement_html": "\t  <style>\t  .enonce{margin-bottom:0}\t  .qcm_prompt2{margin-top:.5em}\t  img{vertical-align:middle;}\t  .q_num, .panel .wims_title{\t    font-size:120%;font-family:Impact, Charcoal, sans-serif;\t    color:#717171;\t  }\t  .feedback{border:1px dashed grey;padding:.5em;margin-top:.5em;}\t  .reponse {\t    margin: 0 1em;\t    padding: .5em;\t    border-radius:5px;\t    color:#555;font-size:90%;\t  }\t  .panel{\t    padding:.5em 1em .5em 1em;\t    margin:.5em 0;\t    border:1px solid #d8d8d8;\t    border-radius:5px;\t  }\t  .panel.callout{\t    border-color:#c5e5f3;\t    border-width:2px;\t    background-color: #F2F9FC;\t  }\t  .callout .q_num, .callout .wims_title{color:black;}\t  .panel .wims_title, .panel .wimscenter{margin-top:-1.2em;}\t  ol li{margin-bottom: .5em;list-style:upper-alpha;}\t  input[type='checkbox'] { font-size:120%; }\t  .strike{text-decoration:line-through;}\t  .oef_indpartial{color:navy;}\t</style>\t  <div class=\"instruction\">Répondez à chaque question d'une première série, validez, puis répondez aux questions de la seconde série.</div>\t                      <fieldset class=\"panel callout\">                 <div class=\"enonce\">\t        <span class=\"q_num\">1. </span>                 <legend class=\"question\">La forme par récurrence d'une suite arithmétique de raison \\(r = 5\\) et de premier terme \\(u_{0} = 10\\) est :</legend>\t      </div>\t          \t              <div class=\"question\">\t          <ol>\t              <li> <label class=\"oef-checkbox-label\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"oef-checkbox\" name=\"reply1\" value=\"1\" /> \\(u_{n}\\) = \\(10 \\cdot 5^{n}\\)</label></li>   <li> <label class=\"oef-checkbox-label\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"oef-checkbox\" name=\"reply1\" value=\"2\" /> \\(u_{n+1}\\) = \\( u_{n}+10 \\) avec \\(u_{0} = 5\\)</label></li>   <li> <label class=\"oef-checkbox-label\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"oef-checkbox\" name=\"reply1\" value=\"3\" /> \\(u_{n+1}\\) = \\(u_{n}+5 \\) avec \\(u_{0} = 10\\)</label></li>   <li> <label class=\"oef-checkbox-label\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"oef-checkbox\" name=\"reply1\" value=\"4\" /> \\(u_{n+1}\\) = \\(10 + 5^{n}\\)</label></li>            </ol>\t        </div>\t                      </fieldset>\t                           <fieldset class=\"panel callout\">                 <div class=\"enonce\">\t        <span class=\"q_num\">2. </span>                 <legend class=\"question\">La forme explicite d'une suite arithmétique de raison \\(r = -3\\) et de premier terme \\(u_{0} = 4\\) est :</legend>\t      </div>\t          \t              <div class=\"question\">\t          <ol>\t              <li> <label class=\"oef-checkbox-label\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"oef-checkbox\" name=\"reply2\" value=\"1\" /> \\(u_{n}\\) = \\(4 - 3 n\\)</label></li>   <li> <label class=\"oef-checkbox-label\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"oef-checkbox\" name=\"reply2\" value=\"2\" /> \\(u_{n+1}\\) = \\(u_{n}-3 \\) avec \\(u_{0} = 4\\)</label></li>   <li> <label class=\"oef-checkbox-label\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"oef-checkbox\" name=\"reply2\" value=\"3\" /> \\(u_{n+1}\\) = \\(4 - 3^{n}\\)</label></li>   <li> <label class=\"oef-checkbox-label\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"oef-checkbox\" name=\"reply2\" value=\"4\" /> \\(u_{n+1}\\) = \\( -3u_{n} \\) avec \\(u_{0} = 4\\)</label></li>            </ol>\t        </div>\t                      </fieldset>\t                           <fieldset class=\"panel callout\">                 <div class=\"enonce\">\t        <span class=\"q_num\">3. </span>                 <legend class=\"question\">La forme par récurrence d'une suite géométrique de raison \\(q = 3\\) et de premier terme \\(u_{0} = 1.8\\) est :</legend>\t      </div>\t          \t              <div class=\"question\">\t          <ol>\t              <li> <label class=\"oef-checkbox-label\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"oef-checkbox\" name=\"reply3\" value=\"1\" /> \\(u_{n}\\) = \\(3 1&#44;8^n\\)</label></li>   <li> <label class=\"oef-checkbox-label\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"oef-checkbox\" name=\"reply3\" value=\"2\" /> \\(u_{n+1}\\) = \\(3 u_{n} \\) avec \\(u_0 =1&#44;8\\)</label></li>   <li> <label class=\"oef-checkbox-label\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"oef-checkbox\" name=\"reply3\" value=\"3\" /> \\(u_{n+1}\\) = \\( u_{n}+3 \\) avec \\( u_0 =1&#44;8\\)</label></li>   <li> <label class=\"oef-checkbox-label\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"oef-checkbox\" name=\"reply3\" value=\"4\" /> \\(u_{n+1}\\) = \\(1&#44;8  3^n\\)</label></li>            </ol>\t        </div>\t                      </fieldset>\t        ",
